==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 29.33 seconds<sup>880f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Chocolate Cat (Enemy)|Chocolate Cat]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**6 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

